<div class="calcpad-output">
 <h3>Math layout regressions</h3>
 <p>
  Stress cases for equation layout. Each case is labelled so a screenshot can be matched back to its source line.
  <i>Math layout regressions MathML.cpd</i>
  renders this file with
  <code>#settings {"mathRenderer": "mathml"}</code>
  for comparison.
 </p>
 <h3>A. Powers</h3>
 <p>A1 power with fraction exponent in a denominator (#282)</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>A</var>
   <sub>1</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    1
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      5
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      4
     </span>
    </sup>
   </span>
   = 1
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>A2 same with variables</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>A</var>
   <sub>2</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>a</var>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>b</var>
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>c</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>d</var>
     </span>
    </sup>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    3
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    4
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      5
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
    </sup>
   </span>
   = 0.0938
  </span>
 </p>
