 <h3>B. Fractions</h3>
 <p>B1 continued fraction, three levels</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>B</var>
   <sub>1</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    1 +
    <span class="dvc">
     1
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     1 +
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>x</var>
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    1 +
    <span class="dvc">
     1
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     1 +
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      0.5
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   = 0.75
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>B2 continued fraction, four levels (switches to ÷)</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>B</var>
   <sub>2</sub>
   = 1 ÷
   <span class="b3">(</span>
   <span class="dvc up">
    1 +
    <span class="dvc">
     1
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     1 +
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      1 +
      <span class="dvc">
       1
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       <var>x</var>
      </span>
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   <span class="b3">)</span>
   = 1 ÷
   <span class="b3">(</span>
   <span class="dvc up">
    1 +
    <span class="dvc">
     1
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     1 +
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      1 +
      <span class="dvc">
       1
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       0.5
      </span>
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   <span class="b3">)</span>
   = 0.571
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>B3 fraction over fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>B</var>
   <sub>3</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>a</var>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>b</var>
    </span>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>c</var>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>d</var>
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <span class="dvc">
     3
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     4
    </span>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     5
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     2
    </span>
   </span>
   = 0.3
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>B4 mixed fractions in numerator and denominator</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>B</var>
   <sub>4</sub>
   =
   <span class="b1">(</span>
   <var>a</var>
   +
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>b</var>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>c</var>
   </span>
   <span class="b1">)</span>
   ÷
   <span class="b2">(</span>
   <span class="dvc down">
    <var>d</var>
    −
    <span class="dvc up">
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>p</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>q</var>
     </span>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>n</var>
    </span>
   </span>
   <span class="b2">)</span>
   =
   <span class="b1">(</span>
   3 +
   <span class="dvc">
    4
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    5
   </span>
   <span class="b1">)</span>
   ÷
   <span class="b2">(</span>
   <span class="dvc down">
    2 −
    <span class="dvc up">
     <span class="dvc">
      7
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      6
     </span>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     3
    </span>
   </span>
   <span class="b2">)</span>
   = 2.36
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>B5 brackets around uneven numerator/denominator heights</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>B</var>
   <sub>5</sub>
   =
   <span class="b2">(</span>
   <span class="dvc up">
    <span class="dvc down">
     <var>a</var>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>b</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>c</var>
     </span>
    </span>
    + 1
   </span>
   <span class="b2">)</span>
   ·
   <var>d</var>
   =
   <span class="b2">(</span>
   <span class="dvc up">
    <span class="dvc down">
     3
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <span class="dvc">
      4
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      5
     </span>
    </span>
    + 1
   </span>
   <span class="b2">)</span>
   · 2 = 9.5
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>B6 brackets around a fraction whose denominator is tall</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>B</var>
   <sub>6</sub>
   =
   <span class="b2">(</span>
   <span class="dvc up">
    1 +
    <span class="dvc down">
     <var>a</var>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>b</var>
     +
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>c</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>d</var>
      +
      <var>x</var>
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   <span class="b2">)</span>
   <sup class="raised">2</sup>
   =
   <span class="b2">(</span>
   <span class="dvc up">
    1 +
    <span class="dvc down">
     3
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     4 +
     <span class="dvc">
      5
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2 + 0.5
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   <span class="b2">)</span>
   <sup class="raised">2</sup>
   = 2.25
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>B7 chained division</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>B</var>
   <sub>7</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <span class="dvc">
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>a</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>b</var>
     </span>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>c</var>
    </span>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>d</var>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <span class="dvc">
     <span class="dvc">
      3
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      4
     </span>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     5
    </span>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    2
   </span>
   = 0.075
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>B8 fraction next to a power in the numerator</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>B</var>
   <sub>8</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>a</var>
    <sup>2</sup>
    +
    <var>b</var>
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
    </sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>c</var>
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>d</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>n</var>
     </span>
    </sup>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    3
    <sup>2</sup>
    + 4
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
    </sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    5
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      2
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
    </sup>
   </span>
   = 3.76
  </span>
 </p>
 <h3>C. Roots</h3>
 <p>C1 root of a fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>C</var>
   <sub>1</sub>
   =
   <span class="o1">
    <span class="r1">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>a</var>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>b</var>
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="o1">
    <span class="r1">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     3
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     4
    </span>
   </span>
   = 0.866
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>C2 nested roots</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>C</var>
   <sub>2</sub>
   =
   <span class="o0">
    <span class="r">√</span>
    1 +
    <span class="o0">
     <span class="r">√</span>
     1 +
     <span class="o0">
      <span class="r">√</span>
      <var>x</var>
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="o0">
    <span class="r">√</span>
    1 +
    <span class="o0">
     <span class="r">√</span>
     1 +
     <span class="o0">
      <span class="r">√</span>
      0.5
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   = 1.52
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>C3 cube root of a fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>C</var>
   <sub>3</sub>
   =
   <small class="nth">3</small>
   <span class="o1">
    <span class="r1">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>a</var>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>b</var>
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <small class="nth">3</small>
   <span class="o1">
    <span class="r1">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     3
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     4
    </span>
   </span>
   = 0.909
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>C4 root in a denominator</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>C</var>
   <sub>4</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <span class="o0">
     <span class="r">√</span>
     <var>a</var>
     <sup>2</sup>
     +
     <var>b</var>
     <sup>2</sup>
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <span class="o0">
     <span class="r">√</span>
     3
     <sup>2</sup>
     + 4
     <sup>2</sup>
    </span>
   </span>
   = 0.2
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>C5 root of a fractional power</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>C</var>
   <sub>5</sub>
   =
   <span class="o0">
    <span class="r">√</span>
    <var>a</var>
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      2
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
    </sup>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="o0">
    <span class="r">√</span>
    3
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      2
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
    </sup>
   </span>
   = 1.44
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>C6 n-th root of a nested fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>C</var>
   <sub>6</sub>
   =
   <small class="nth">5</small>
   <span class="o2">
    <span class="r2">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc up">
     <span class="dvc down">
      <var>x</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      1 +
      <span class="dvc">
       <var>x</var>
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       <var>y</var>
      </span>
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <small class="nth">5</small>
   <span class="o2">
    <span class="r2">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc up">
     <span class="dvc down">
      0.5
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      1 +
      <span class="dvc">
       0.5
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       2
      </span>
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   = 0.833
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>C7 root raised to a fractional power</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>C</var>
   <sub>7</sub>
   =
   <span class="o0">
    <span class="r">√</span>
    <var>y</var>
   </span>
   <sup>
    <span class="dvc">
     3
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     2
    </span>
   </sup>
   =
   <span class="o0">
    <span class="r">√</span>
    2
   </span>
   <sup>
    <span class="dvc">
     3
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     2
    </span>
   </sup>
   = 1.68
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>C8 root of a continued fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>C</var>
   <sub>8</sub>
   =
   <span class="o2">
    <span class="r2">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc up">
     1 +
     <span class="dvc down">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      1 +
      <span class="dvc">
       1
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       1 +
       <var>x</var>
      </span>
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="o2">
    <span class="r2">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc up">
     1 +
     <span class="dvc down">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      1 +
      <span class="dvc">
       1
       <span class="dvl">
       </span>
       1 + 0.5
      </span>
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   = 1.26
  </span>
 </p>
 <h3>D. Brackets and absolute value</h3>
 <p>D1 nested bracket levels</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>D</var>
   <sub>1</sub>
   =  (  (
   <var>a</var>
   +
   <var>b</var>
   )  ·  (
   <var>c</var>
   −  (
   <var>d</var>
   +
   <var>x</var>
   −
   <var>y</var>
   )  )  )
   <sup>2</sup>
   =  (  ( 3 + 4 )  ·  ( 5 −  ( 2 + 0.5 − 2 )  )  )
   <sup>2</sup>
   = 992.25
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>D2 absolute value of a difference of fractions</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>D</var>
   <sub>2</sub>
   =
   <span class="b1">|</span>
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>a</var>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>b</var>
   </span>
   −
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>c</var>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>d</var>
   </span>
   <span class="b1">|</span>
   =
   <span class="b1">|</span>
   <span class="dvc">
    3
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    4
   </span>
   −
   <span class="dvc">
    5
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    2
   </span>
   <span class="b1">|</span>
   = 1.75
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>D3 redundant brackets around a fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>D</var>
   <sub>3</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>a</var>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>b</var>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    3
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    4
   </span>
   = 0.75
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>D4 bracketed fraction in a denominator</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>D</var>
   <sub>4</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc down">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>a</var>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>b</var>
    </span>
    +
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>c</var>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>d</var>
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc down">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     3
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     4
    </span>
    +
    <span class="dvc">
     5
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     2
    </span>
   </span>
   = 0.308
  </span>
 </p>
 <h3>E. Sums, products and integrals</h3>
 <p>E1 sum of a fraction with a power</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>E</var>
   <sub>1</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvr">
    <small>10</small>
    <span class="nary">∑</span>
    <small>
     <var>k</var>
     = 1
    </small>
   </span>
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>k</var>
    <sup>2</sup>
   </span>
   = 1.55
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>E2 sum in a denominator</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>E</var>
   <sub>2</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <span class="dvr">
     <small>10</small>
     <span class="nary">∑</span>
     <small>
      <var>k</var>
      = 1
     </small>
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     1
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>k</var>
     <sup>2</sup>
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    1.55
   </span>
   = 0.645
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>E3 integral of a fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>E</var>
   <sub>3</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvr">
    <small>1</small>
    <span class="nary">
     <em>∫</em>
    </span>
    <small>0</small>
   </span>
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    1 +
    <var>t</var>
    <sup>2</sup>
   </span>
   d
   <var>t</var>
   = 0.785
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>E4 sum with factorial in denominator, over a fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>E</var>
   <sub>4</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <span class="dvr">
     <small>10</small>
     <span class="nary">∑</span>
     <small>
      <var>k</var>
      = 0
     </small>
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>x</var>
     <sup>
      <var>k</var>
     </sup>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>k</var>
     !
    </span>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    1 +
    <var>x</var>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1.65
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    1 + 0.5
   </span>
   = 1.1
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>E5 product raised to a fractional power</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>E</var>
   <sub>5</sub>
   =
   <span class="b2">(</span>
   <span class="dvr">
    <small>10</small>
    <span class="nary">∏</span>
    <small>
     <var>k</var>
     = 1
    </small>
   </span>
   <span class="b1">(</span>
   1 +
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>k</var>
    <sup>2</sup>
   </span>
   <span class="b1">)</span>
   <span class="b2">)</span>
   <sup class="raised">
    <span class="dvc">
     1
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     2
    </span>
   </sup>
   = 3.34
   <sup>
    <span class="dvc">
     1
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     2
    </span>
   </sup>
   = 1.83
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>E6 integral with fraction limits</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>E</var>
   <sub>6</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvr">
    <small>
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>a</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>b</var>
     </span>
    </small>
    <span class="nary">
     <em>∫</em>
    </span>
    <small>
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>a</var>
     </span>
    </small>
   </span>
   <var>t</var>
   <sup>2</sup>
   d
   <var>t</var>
   = 0.128
  </span>
 </p>
 <h3>F. Conditionals</h3>
 <p>F1 if with fractions</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>F</var>
   <sub>1</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvcs">
    <span class="c3">{</span>
    <span class="dvs">
     if
     <var>a</var>
     &lt;
     <var>b</var>
     :
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>a</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>b</var>
     </span>
     <br/>
     else:
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>b</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>a</var>
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvcs">
    <span class="c3">{</span>
    <span class="dvs">
     if 3 &lt; 4:
     <span class="dvc">
      3
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      4
     </span>
     <br/>
     else:
     <span class="dvc">
      4
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   = 0.75
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>F2 switch inside a fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>F</var>
   <sub>2</sub>
   = 1 ÷
   <span class="b5">(</span>
   1 +
   <span class="dvcs">
    <span class="c5">{</span>
    <span class="dvs">
     if
     <var>x</var>
     &lt; 1:
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>x</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
     <br/>
     else if
     <var>x</var>
     &lt; 2:
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>x</var>
      <sup>2</sup>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
     <br/>
     else: 1
    </span>
   </span>
   <span class="b5">)</span>
   = 1 ÷
   <span class="b5">(</span>
   1 +
   <span class="dvcs">
    <span class="c5">{</span>
    <span class="dvs">
     if 0.5 &lt; 1:
     <span class="dvc">
      0.5
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
     <br/>
     else if 0.5 &lt; 2:
     <span class="dvc">
      0.5
      <sup>2</sup>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
     <br/>
     else: 1
    </span>
   </span>
   <span class="b5">)</span>
   = 0.8
  </span>
 </p>
 <h3>G. Units and number formatting</h3>
 <p>G1 section modulus with units and substitution</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>G</var>
   <sub>1</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc down">
    <var>M</var>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>b</var>
     <sub>w</sub>
     ·
     <var>h</var>
     <sup>2</sup>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     6
    </span>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc down">
    45
    <i>kN</i>
    <i>·</i>
    <i>m</i>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <span class="dvc">
     300
     <i>mm</i>
     ·  ( 500
     <i>mm</i>
     )
     <sup>2</sup>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     6
    </span>
   </span>
   = 3.6
   <i>MPa</i>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>G2 unit powers in the denominator</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>G</var>
   <sub>2</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>q</var>
    <sub>d</sub>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>L</var>
    <sup>2</sup>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    12
    <i>kN</i>
    <i class="unit">∕</i>
    <i>m</i>
    <sup class="unit">2</sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    ( 6
    <i>m</i>
    )
    <sup>2</sup>
   </span>
   = 0.333
   <i>kN</i>
   <i class="unit">∕</i>
   <i>m</i>
   <sup class="unit">4</sup>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>G3 fractional unit exponent</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>G</var>
   <sub>3</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>k</var>
    <sub>s</sub>
    <sup>2</sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>L</var>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    ( 2
    <i>m</i>
    <sup class="unit">
     1
     <em>/</em>
     2
    </sup>
    )
    <sup>2</sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    6
    <i>m</i>
   </span>
   = 0.667
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>G4 scientific notation in a denominator</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>G</var>
   <sub>4</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>x</var>
    · 10
    <sup>-8</sup>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    0.5 · 10
    <sup>-8</sup>
   </span>
   = 200000000
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>G5 scientific notation raised to a power</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>G</var>
   <sub>5</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    10
    <sup>-5</sup>
    ∙
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
    </sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>a</var>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    10
    <sup>-5</sup>
    ∙
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
    </sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    3
   </span>
   = 0.00105
  </span>
 </p>
 <h3>H. Subscripts with powers</h3>
 <p>H1 subscripted base with fractional power over subscripted variable</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>H</var>
   <sub>1</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc up">
    <span class="o1">
     <span class="r1">
     </span>
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>f</var>
      <sub>ck</sub>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <i>MPa</i>
     </span>
    </span>
    <sup class="raised">
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
    </sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>γ</var>
    <sub>c</sub>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc up">
    <span class="o1">
     <span class="r1">
     </span>
     <span class="dvc">
      30
      <i>MPa</i>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <i>MPa</i>
     </span>
    </span>
    <sup class="raised">
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
    </sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    1.5
   </span>
   = 1.56
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>H2 subscripts on both sides of a fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>H</var>
   <sub>2</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>A</var>
    <sub>1</sub>
    <sup>2</sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>A</var>
    <sub>3</sub>
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      2
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
    </sup>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <sup>2</sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    0.487
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      2
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      3
     </span>
    </sup>
   </span>
   = 1.62
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>H3 subscript and fractional power in a denominator</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>H</var>
   <sub>3</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <var>B</var>
    <sub>1</sub>
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      <var>n</var>
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
    </sup>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    0.75
    <sup>
     <span class="dvc">
      3
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
    </sup>
   </span>
   = 1.54
  </span>
 </p>
 <h3>I. Vectors and matrices</h3>
 <p>I1 vector over its norm</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>
    <span class="vec">⃗</span>
    v
   </var>
   =
   <span class="b0">[</span>
   1; 2; 3
   <span class="b0">]</span>
   =
   <b class="b0">[</b>
   1 2 3
   <b class="b0">]</b>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>
    <span class="vec">⃗</span>
    I
   </var>
   <sub>1</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>
     <span class="vec">⃗</span>
     v
    </var>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <b>norm</b>
    (
    <var>
     <span class="vec">⃗</span>
     v
    </var>
    )
   </span>
   =
   <b class="b0">[</b>
   0.267 0.535 0.802
   <b class="b0">]</b>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>I2 matrix expression divided by a determinant</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <b>
    <var>K</var>
   </b>
   =
   <span class="b0">[</span>
   <var>a</var>
   ;
   <var>b</var>
   <span class="b0">|</span>
   <var>c</var>
   ;
   <var>d</var>
   <span class="b0">]</span>
   =
   <span class="b0">[</span>
   3; 4
   <span class="b0">|</span>
   5; 2
   <span class="b0">]</span>
   =
   <span class="matrix">
    <span class="tr">
     <span class="td">
     </span>
     <span class="td">3</span>
     <span class="td">4</span>
     <span class="td">
     </span>
    </span>
    <span class="tr">
     <span class="td">
     </span>
     <span class="td">5</span>
     <span class="td">2</span>
     <span class="td">
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <b>
    <var>I</var>
   </b>
   <sub>2</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <b>inverse</b>
    (
    <b>
     <var>K</var>
    </b>
    )
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <b>det</b>
    (
    <b>
     <var>K</var>
    </b>
    )
   </span>
   =
   <span class="matrix">
    <span class="tr">
     <span class="td">
     </span>
     <span class="td">0.0102</span>
     <span class="td">-0.0204</span>
     <span class="td">
     </span>
    </span>
    <span class="tr">
     <span class="td">
     </span>
