 <h3>J. Functions</h3>
 <p>J1 squared function of a fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>J</var>
   <sub>1</sub>
   =
   <b>sin</b>
   <span class="b1">(</span>
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>x</var>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    2
   </span>
   <span class="b1">)</span>
   <sup class="raised">2</sup>
   =
   <b>sin</b>
   <span class="b1">(</span>
   <span class="dvc">
    0.5
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    2
   </span>
   <span class="b1">)</span>
   <sup class="raised">2</sup>
   = 1.9×10
   <sup>-5</sup>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>J2 log of a nested fraction</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>J</var>
   <sub>2</sub>
   =
   <b>ln</b>
   <span class="b2">(</span>
   <span class="dvc up">
    1 +
    <span class="dvc down">
     <var>x</var>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>y</var>
     +
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      <var>z</var>
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   <span class="b2">)</span>
   =
   <b>ln</b>
   <span class="b2">(</span>
   <span class="dvc up">
    1 +
    <span class="dvc down">
     0.5
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     2 +
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      1.5
     </span>
    </span>
   </span>
   <span class="b2">)</span>
   = 0.172
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>J3 function powers in numerator and denominator</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>J</var>
   <sub>3</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc up">
    <b>sin</b>
    <span class="b1">(</span>
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>π</var>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     4
    </span>
    <span class="b1">)</span>
    <sup class="raised">
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
    </sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <b>cos</b>
    (
    <var>x</var>
    )
    <sup>2</sup>
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc up">
    <b>sin</b>
    <span class="b1">(</span>
    <span class="dvc">
     3.14
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     4
    </span>
    <span class="b1">)</span>
    <sup class="raised">
     <span class="dvc">
      1
      <span class="dvl">
      </span>
      2
     </span>
    </sup>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    <b>cos</b>
    ( 0.5 )
    <sup>2</sup>
   </span>
   = 0.117
  </span>
 </p>
